<title>SOUTH KOREA: New Star seeks help to stop raider.</title>
<headline>New Star seeks help to stop raider.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Star Trading Co, a target of what if successful would be South Korea's first hostile takeover bid of a listed company, is seeking a white knight to ward off a corporate raider, the company president said on Friday.</p>
